#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:92
#: 068e0b47677348ad80fe04a849e77dc6
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:94
#: d262491e1c33490ca1f79e98e7e386a9
msgid ""
"The RX6 (UART6 RX), is by default is mapped to a timer input instead of the "
"UART, and can be used for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except"
" CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, "
"when connected in this manner, can provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RX6（UART6 RX）默认映射到定时器输入而非 UART，支持所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 "
"除外（这些协议需要真实 UART 连接）。不过，FPort 以此方式连接时可提供 RC 功能（无数传）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:96
#: b7d7a8bd7e6f46b7b48578aa46c81518
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the RX6 pin can also be configured to be used as true UART6 RX "
"pin for use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL6 "
"port's RX input pin."
msgstr ""
"为使用 FPort、CRSF、SRXL2 接收机中的 CRSF 和内嵌数传功能，RX6 引脚也可通过将 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设置为「1」来配置为真实 UART6 RX 引脚，供双向系统使用，成为 "
"SERIAL6 接口的 RX 输入引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:98
#: 5dca3d14b58c4774bf63d020c5dace7f
msgid ""
"With this option, :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` must be set to "
"\"23\", and:"
msgstr "使用此选项时，:ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 必须设置为 「23」，并且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:100
#: e6a7b3cfd2554d5aa427eecf165e7405
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:102
#: b7dfc33a71fb4fe7a7d32def3098a2a4
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX6  pin."
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 RX6 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:104
#: 5781f4d7f9c2444cba7427c5ee38d5fa
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX6 and RX6 via a bi-directional inverter. See "
":ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr "FPort 需通过双向电平转换器连接至 TX6 和 RX6。请参阅 :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:106
#: e312bade52134427abe58daaa49081fd
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX6 connection, in addition to RX6, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除 RX6 外还需连接 TX6，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:108
#: 6728f8c6e8c84936adf5e04d82eacab5
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX6 and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需连接至 TX6，并可自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 '4'。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:110
#: e43541f9c751410381940b014e2a1838
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:113
#: e6aabc933cde4237bac316188d08d457
msgid "USB Power"
msgstr "USB 供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:115
#: aabc7c5db7f64b479d3a7f3ba27bbee2
msgid ""
"When connected to USB, pins marked 5V are powered. Be careful not to "
"overload the USB host's current capability. Powering the autopilot, and an "
"RX and GPS is usually within most USB host's capabilities, however."
msgstr ""
"连接 USB 时，标有 5V 的引脚有电。注意不要超出 USB 主机的电流能力。通常，为飞控、接收机和 GPS 供电在大多数 USB "
"主机的能力范围之内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:119
#: 7c016461029a4653a71a5e3301bcba72
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:121
#: 158faf9a8eb64c538a29a279617a3ec2
msgid ""
"The KakuteH7-Wing supports using its internal OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver). External OSD support such as DJI or DisplayPort is supported using "
"UART5 or any other free UART. See :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2` for "
"more info."
msgstr ""
"KakuteH7-Wing 支持使用其内置 OSD，采用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）。外部 OSD 支持（如 DJI 或 "
"DisplayPort）可通过 UART5 或其他空闲 UART 实现。详见 :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:124
#: b55a5876ef6b4e2a95834332f7e00689
msgid "Camera and VTX Control"
msgstr "摄像头与图传控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:126
#: c05b61af4a7c436391428ab6e9daebae
msgid ""
"The pin marked 9V (can be selected by jumper on the rear of the board to be "
"9V or 12V)."
msgstr "标记为 9V 的引脚（可通过板子背面的跳线选择 9V 或 12V）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:128
#: 01f24950440744c6a53e7ca948a88fa9
msgid ""
"Switching between the two camera inputs, C1 (default on) or C2, and between "
"on (default) and off of the 9V supply pin can be implemented using the Relay"
" function of ArduPilot and assigning the relays to an ``RCx_OPTION`` switch "
"on the transmitter."
msgstr ""
"两路摄像头输入之间的切换（C1 默认开启，或 C2），以及 9V 供电引脚的开关（默认开启），可通过 ArduPilot "
"的继电器功能实现，并将继电器分配到遥控器上的 ``RCx_OPTION`` 开关。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:130
#: a8ccca32ed7842e19d3837ccd0b9164b
msgid ""
"Set the ``RELAYx_PIN`` to \"82\" for on/off of 9V supply, and to \"81\" to "
"control the camera switching. Then select an RC channel for control (Chx) "
"and set its ``RCx_OPTION`` to the appropriate Relay (1-4) that you had set "
"its pin parameter above."
msgstr ""
"将 ``RELAYx_PIN`` 设置为 「82」 以控制 9V 供电的开关，设置为 「81」 以控制摄像头切换。然后为控制通道（Chx）选择一个 RC"
" 通道，并将其 ``RCx_OPTION`` 设置为对应的继电器（1-4），该继电器的引脚参数已在上方设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:133
#: 2e0921c90ce14cb9a633925143579820
msgid ""
"For example, use Channel 10 to control the camera switch using Relay 2:"
msgstr "例如，使用通道 10 通过继电器 2 控制摄像头切换："

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:135
#: 3a21b0eebf304a68a45f5521d1ec0f74
msgid ":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` = \"81\""
msgstr ":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` = 「81」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:136
#: 10a6e986de064a2ba5916b8857eb0aeb
msgid ":ref:`RC10_OPTION<RC10_OPTION>` = \"34\" (Relay2 Control)"
msgstr ":ref:`RC10_OPTION<RC10_OPTION>` = 「34」（继电器 2 控制）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:138
#: 3c7b0901edd9417c94462a1770eb9910
msgid ""
"setting Relay on/high assigned for 9V pin will turn on that supply. "
"Likewise, setting on/high for the Relay assigned for camera, will switch "
"from Camera 1 to Camera 2."
msgstr "将分配给 9V 引脚的继电器设置为开/高将打开该供电。同样，将分配给摄像头的继电器设置为开/高将从摄像头1切换到摄像头2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:141
#: 297886a5991f49268774529bf12e4197
msgid "CAN"
msgstr "CAN"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:143
#: 9a1424b9ac804b529954eaf9f0a7f549
msgid ""
"The KakuteH7-Wing has one CAN port (port 1 parameters should be used) "
"available for connecting CAN and DroneCAN peripherals such as GPS and "
